#34612
@DThe Hall of the @MFi@Wrst @MLa@Wdy@n~
This chamber lies within the inner household tier reserved for
Kokudar, Elyria, Vaelreth, and the senior retainers of the citadel.
Violet lanternlight moves across crimson stone, silver fittings, and
polished walnut while tapestries record campaigns, old strongholds,
and places worth remembering. Burgundy runners and wine-red upholstery
soften the fortress architecture without making the household feel
fragile.
~
