#34619
The Night Watch Post~
This chamber belongs to the citadel's household and security quarter.
Deep red stone, dark walnut, burgundy runners, and brass fittings are
finished for hard daily use. Footsteps, kitchen work, guard reports,
linen carts, medical supplies, and the disciplined movement of the
Veiled Blades keep this wing active even when Kokudar is elsewhere.
