banners hang above campaign maps, weapon racks, training scars, signal
bells, and carefully maintained furnishings. Kaelen's guards and
Elyria's battlemaids use these halls for drills, briefings, meals,
patrol changes, and rapid response whenever the stronghold shifts from
quiet watch to active defense.
